I followed Mitoko's gaze and considered my apparel.%K%P
我顺着美都子有些鄙夷的视线，\n打量一下自己的身体…%K%P
I was still wearing the pink sweatsuit I borrowed from Ms.\nKaya that only reached down to my knees and completely\nexposed my stomach area.%K%P
从夏夜小姐那里借的，\n膝盖、上膊和肚子露出来的粉红色运动衫。%K%P
And on top of that, in the hurry to dash outside, I\nborrowed her sandals.%K%P
无可争辩的女式拖鞋…%K%P
