%LC夏夜
\dI don't know them.\d%K%P
「不～知道」%K%P
I was wondering why exactly everyone gathered around us\nwas whispering things that didn't seem all that\nflattering! Well, that's that mystery solved!%K%P
从刚才起就感觉周围人们好像在说着奇怪的悄悄话，\n而且频率高到已经能让人清楚听到了。\n原来问题出在这里啊！%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBack off, you pervert! You think it's okay to dress like\nthat just because no one else sees it? In fact, it seems\nlike you feel right at home in those clothes!\d%K%P
「别靠近我，变态。\n因为在家里所以不觉得这个打扮难为情么？\n话说看来你对这里是相当习惯了啊～！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait a second, Mitoko! Let me explain...!\d%K%P
