%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhuahhh!!\d%K%P
「唔哇啊！？」%K%P
Evidently, I'd just been demoted to an even lower rung on\nthe social ladder than \ddivorce boy\d...%K%P
原来还有比『领过证的』\n更低级的称呼…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmph. I'm not angry or anything. I mean, gigolos are men,\ntoo. And this woman seems all grown up and mature, just\nperfect for you.\d%K%P
「才没有发怒～。\n情夫也是男人嘛～。\n这个人是个既漂亮又成熟的大姐姐嘛～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait, Mitoko...! You can call me whatever you want, but\ndo you realize how rude you are being to Ms. Kaya right\nnow?\d%K%P
