%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dGood luck with that.\d%K%P
「加油哦～」%K%P
Incredible... she didn't seem fazed by any of this.%K%P
好厉害…\n这个人然能如此冷静地观察事态。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, you don't need to be so scared of me. I told you I\nwouldn't get all emotional and force you out just like\nthat, remember?\d%K%P
「所以说，你也用不着害怕啦。\n我是不会感情用事而说出要你离开之类的话的，\n之前就说过了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yeah, you did.\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊…」%K%P
I see, so that slap wasn't her getting all emotional on\nme.%K%P
这样啊，刚才的耳光不是感情用事啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo, I'm going to calm down and say this with perfect\ncomposure, okay? ...Get the hell out of the Terrace House\nHinosaka.\d%K%P
