%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶………？」%K%P
Um, so she was talking about the \dall emotional\d and not\nthe \dforce you out\d part in that previous sentence, then?%K%P
她并不是想表达『不说』让我『搬出去』，\n而是否定『感情用事』么？%K%P
Basic grammar can be so hard sometimes...%K%P
国语的语法好难啊…%K%P
