My hand grasped only air as Mitoko darted down the stairs.%K%P
美都子甩开我伸过去的手，\n走下楼梯。%K%P
I found myself unable to move as despair washed over all\nmy senses. I couldn't even chase after her...%K%P
我的脚停在那里，绝望感蔓延全身，\n甚至连追上她都做不到…%K%P
I mean, how was I supposed to go to town dressed like\nthis?%K%P
因为，以这个打扮去甬道里追她，这也…%K%P
