%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI don't have the funds for that. Don't underestimate the\npoverty of actors.\d%K%P
「因为没有买鱼饵的钱啊。\n我那穷剧团就够让人头疼的了～」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dBesides, you should stop going after the women in your\ntroupe. You might get stabbed one day, you know?\d%K%P
「不要把同一个剧团的女人都吃尽啊。\n说不定哪天会被人捅的哦？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dDon't worry, man. Lately -- partially because of that,\nactually -- all we've been doing was social satire stuff\nwith an all-dude cast.\d%K%P
「没关系，最近的书上有预想到那个，\n就当那是莫名其妙的社会讽刺好了。\n男角色都是由我来分配的」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI wonder what your colleagues would think if they knew\nyour antics were responsible for their current jobs.\d%K%P
「如果剧团演员的各位知道自己戏剧的角色，\n是因为这种理由而被决定的话，定会哭晕在厕所的…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI guess they wouldn't be too happy. Anyway, what do you\nthink is gonna become of those two?\d%K%P
「那倒也是…\n那两个人怎么样了？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYou mean the Young Master and the Young Mistress?\d%K%P
「小少爷和小房东么？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYou know, I've been thinking... Don't their quarrels\nremind you of a married couple's?\d%K%P
「怎么说呢，虽然我的是一己之见，\n不过你不觉得他们吵架的理由\n越来越有男女之间的那种意思了么？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIndeed, I suppose they have gone far beyond what you'd\nnormally expect from a teenager arguing with her parents.\d%K%P
「说是父女之间的争吵，情味的确是太过浓烈了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHow far apart in age do they think they are...? I mean,\nLaid-off is older than Kuma and me.\d%K%P
「我觉得多少该有些偏差吧…\n失业的他比我和小熊都要年长哦？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dThe Young Mistress is too capable and disciplined to take\nadvantage of the kindness of adults. Meanwhile, the Young\nMaster is too unreliable to properly spoil her like a\nparent would.\d%K%P
「小房东太过自立而不知道如何向父亲撒娇。\n相反的，小少爷太不可靠而不知道如何去疼爱孩子」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat's Laid-off's fault, no matter how you look at it.\d%K%P
「这是失业者的错啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYes, it most certainly is.\d%K%P
「是小少爷的错啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dBut, you know... It would suck if he had to leave for\nreal. I was writing a book inspired by his life, and I got\nstuck just recently.\d%K%P
「不过啊…他被赶出去的话就没意思了，\n而且现在我正在写一本以他为原型的书，\n没有后续的话会让我很头疼的」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dThat depends on the Young Mistress. You should go to her\nroom and negotiate on his behalf. Like, say something\nalong the lines of 'Please don't let the person I love\nleave me all alone in the world.'\d%K%P
「要不要把他赶出去是小房东决定的吧？\n去她的房间直接找她谈谈吧。\n说“请不要把我喜欢的人赶出去”什么的，怎样？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI don't want that to make her change her opinion about my\npassions, but I'm probably more scared of her exploding in\nrivalrous fury as a result, truth be told.\d%K%P
「虽然被蔑视很可怕，\n不过，真的被激起对抗心才是最可怕的」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dLook at this coward. Very well, then. It seems like it's\ntime for me to take the stage.\d%K%P
「你真是没出息。\n没办法，这里我就来尽一份力吧」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dOh, about that... I think she's kinda busy right now.\d%K%P
「啊，那个嘛…\n现在，又有麻烦的客人来了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou want me to transfer schools?\d%K%P
「转校…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes, to Nansen Academy. It's one of the schools\naffiliated with our Shuusen. In other words, my father is\none of the principals.\d%K%P
「是的，南泉学苑。\n与秋泉合作的学校之一…也就是说，理事长之一是我的父亲」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIsn't that the same school you went to?\d%K%P
「我记得那个…是姫绪姐的母校吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes. It's a good place. It's an all-girls school, but no\none is going to force you to become a prim and proper lady\nor something silly like that, so don't feel intimidated.\d%K%P
「是的。是个好地方哦。\n虽然是女校，不过不是那种娇生惯养的大小姐学校，放心吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dW-Wait a second. This is way too sudden. But most\nimportantly... why?\d%K%P
「等、等一下？\n为什么突然…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWas it really that sudden?  I think I invited you\nmultiple times before going to the US.\d%K%P
「很突然么？\n从我留学之前开始，就多次邀请过你了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah, but I mean... Nansen is in...\d%K%P
「那个…可是，南泉…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYeah, Nagoya.\d%K%P
「嗯，在名古屋」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI like the place. They offer food that's filling and\nsizable... cheap, too. The menu can get a bit weird at\ntimes, but that only adds to the fun.\d%K%P
「那是个好地方哦。\n饭很好吃，又便宜，量还多，\n偶尔还会有奇怪的菜色，很有意思的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, could you maybe elaborate on that last bit...?\d%K%P
「最后那个…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOur manufacturing industries are on the rise; we've got\nboth professional baseball and soccer teams. It's\nhilarious to pick up a local newspaper and see all the\nblatant favoritism everywhere.\d%K%P
「制造业很发达，还有职业棒球队和职业足球队。\n那儿的新闻媒体对当地的偏心报道\n看着都让人心情舒畅哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dB-But Nagoya is...\d%K%P
「可、可是名古屋什么的…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI didn't just come up with this on the spot. ...There's\nsome information that reached me recently.\d%K%P
「我也不是一时兴起才提出的。\n…只是获得了一点消息」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat do you mean?\d%K%P
「消息…？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMom was there...?\d%K%P
「妈妈…么？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYes, around a month ago -- at 10 o'clock on the 29th of\nApril -- she was seen to board a train along with a man.\d%K%P
「一个月前，４月２９日晚上１０点。\n最后有人看到她好像和一个男人在一起上了车哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dB-But she could have gotten off anywhere.\d%K%P
「只、只有这些么，在哪里下的啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dApparently, her ticket was to Nagoya.\d%K%P
「说是她手里拿着去名古屋的车票」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou understand what this means, don't you?\d%K%P
「这下你就明白是怎么回事了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIs Mom in Nagoya...?\d%K%P
「妈妈在…名古屋？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt's not very efficient to leave the search to unrelated\nparties. I mean, it took a whole month for us to find out\nthis much.\d%K%P
「派别人去找是没有效率的。\n更何况调查到现在已经快一个月了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut why are you doing this...?\d%K%P
「姬绪姐…为什么？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSo I thought it would be better for someone who actually\nknows Ms. Honoka to continue the search. Like you... or\nme.\d%K%P
「所以，我觉得之后让认识穗香小姐的人，\n直接去寻找才是最有效率的。\n对，比如说，小都子，或者我」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's not what I'm asking. Why are you doing all this\nfor someone like me? ...We're just neighbors, I have\nnothing to offer you in exchange.\d%K%P
「我问的不是这个啊。\n为什么你要为了我，拼命努力到这个地步啊？\n…只是住在隔壁，就这么为我操心」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHaven't I said this a billion times?\d%K%P
「我应该早就说过了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt's because you're an important friend to me, Toko. Is\nthat not enough?\d%K%P
「因为我很重视小都子你。\n只是这样，不行么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姬绪姐」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI know you love the Terrace House Hinosaka very much. And\nI understand you want to wait for your mother here.\d%K%P
「我知道小都子你很珍视Terrace House阳之坂。\n也能理解你想在这里等妈妈回来的心情」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dY-Yeah...\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dBut, you know... sometimes, it's better to take matters\ninto your own hands instead of waiting. At least I prefer\nthat kind of approach.\d%K%P
「可是呢…我觉得比起等待，\n还是自己主动出去寻找更好。\n至少这是我的处事方式」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's... true, I guess, but...\d%K%P
「或许…是这样，可是」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou can stay at my house over there. I'll be living there\nas well, so no need to be overly self-conscious and\nreserved.\d%K%P
「在那边来我家往也行哦。\n当然了，我也是要和你一起回去的。\n所以你不必客气」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dN-No, that sounds crazy! I don't understand why you're\ngoing so far for me!\d%K%P
「那、那个…怎么能行。\n为我做到这个地步，实在是没有道理啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI don't want to sound conceited, but my house has\ncountless vacant rooms and servants that currently have\nnothing to do. It's not a big deal for me. I can do it all\nwithout much of a reason.\d%K%P
「虽然这么说不太好…\n不过我的家有多余房间，也有足够的佣人。\n所以即便真的没有道理，我也可以做到这个地步」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAnd I definitely have a reason for this: the betterment\nof your life.\d%K%P
「更何况，我这么做是有正当理由的。\n为了小都子你，对吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut that's... um...\d%K%P
「怎么会…那个…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDo you hate the idea of living with me that much?\d%K%P
「对于我的提案，\n你就那么不情愿吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dTh-That's not it! I'm really happy! I'm really grateful,\ntoo! But... But, listen...\d%K%P
「不、不是的！\n我非常高兴，非常庆幸哦。\n可是，可是…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOr do you have another reason you want to say, besides\nyour mother?\d%K%P
「还是说…\n除了妈妈的事情，\n还有其它让你必须待在这里的理由？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「呃…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dFor example, something that has to do with fixing a\ncertain someone's diet, or feeling like having to look\nafter a certain someone until they find a proper job and\ncan stand on their own two feet?\d%K%P
「比如，必须要治好挑食啦，\n必须要照顾直到找到工作啦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dTh-That's not... That's...\d%K%P
「那、那种事情…那种事情…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dA certain someone that could be practically anywhere\nright now, doing god-knows-what with god-knows-who.\d%K%P
「…为了现在不知道正和谁做着什么的某人，是吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!\d%K%P
「…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...You want to stay here no matter what? In that case, we\ncan forget we had this conversation. Just give me an\nhonest answer.\d%K%P
「…无论如何你还是想待在这里么？\n那样的话，忘了刚才我说的吧。\n坦率点给个答复就行了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's not... No, not at all. I don't care about staying\nhere that much.\d%K%P
「那种事，当然没有…没有的，完全没有」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dGreat. You can leave all the boring legal procedures to\nme. All you have to do is board the train to Nagoya when\nthe time comes.\d%K%P
「决定了。\n手续全都在这边预先办好。\n小都子，你只身过去就可以了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWait, you're being too sudden...!\d%K%P
「那么急着…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYeah, I suppose you'd want to say your goodbyes to your\nfriends. You can take it slow if you want, dedicate a\nsolid week to saying farewell.\d%K%P
「也是呢，你也要和朋友告个别。\n用一周的时间慢慢准备也是可以的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dLet's go look for your mother together! ...It's all gonna\nwork out, okay?\d%K%P
「一起去找你的母亲吧？\n…这都是为了你啊」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...She's transferring schools?\d%K%P
「…转校，是么？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYeah, Milady seems to be planning to close this place\ndown and take her to Nagoya. ...Our biggest fears are\nbecoming a reality.\d%K%P
「啊啊，好像是要把这里关了去名古屋。\n…害怕到来的事正在逐渐变成现实啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI respect your brazenness for eavesdropping on them like\nit was the most natural thing in the world.\d%K%P
「我倒是对理所当然去偷听的熊先生感到意外啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dHmph, when Laid-off's wife was here, you were listening\nto their convo like you'd become seventy years younger,\ngramps.\d%K%P
「明明失业者的夫人来的时候，\n您不也是满心欢喜地偷听来着」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh, I remember that match like it was yesterday. A\nroller-coaster ride of the closest shogi bout I'd ever\nhad.\d%K%P
「那时的对局是白热化的啊。\n正如一进一退的业余将棋」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dW-Wait, guys, aren't we kinda fucked here?! The li'l\nlandlord doesn't seem to even remember us!\d%K%P
「等、等下，比那种事还糟糕啊！\n房东小妹她眼中好像没有我们啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...Well, I can't exactly blame her.\d%K%P
「…嘛，想想迄今为止的事，那是理所当然的吧」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhat will we do? Should we refuse to leave and lock\nourselves in our rooms?\d%K%P
「怎么办？\n闭门不出来抗议她搬走？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI don't know... That doesn't sound too different from\nwhat we normally do, anyway.\d%K%P
「总觉那个也…\n再说，那和我们平时的所为别无二致吧」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dDon't cause the Young Mistress any more trouble. If\nthat's what she decided, the least a true man can do is\nlet her follow her own path.\d%K%P
「不能再让小房东加剧困扰了啊。\n如果那孩子是认真的，二话不说就会把男人都赶走哦」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI get what you mean, but we're talking about that cunning\nfox of a woman, y'know? Who knows what traps she has\nprepared for our li'l landlord over there.\d%K%P
「就算你这么说，但对方可是那个女狐狸哦？\n谁知道会设怎样卑劣的陷阱…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dGoddammit. If only we had Laid-off to rely on right now!\nWhere the hell is that guy loitering at a time like\nthis?!\d%K%P
「可恶～，如果这时候失业者在的话…\n那家伙到底去哪里溜达了！」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dIf only Laid-off was here with us right now... man, that\nguy's underdog aura never fails to trigger the motherly\ninstincts of any woman that stumbles upon him.\d%K%P
「那个散发着强烈废柴气息的失业者，\n只要看到他那样子，所有的女性都能最大限度地\n解放出母性本能，如果他在的话…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...Oh, so you did know why he was popular with the\nladies, then.\d%K%P
「…你很清楚嘛。\n只有小少爷是受欢迎的啊」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dWhat?!\d%K%P
「什么！？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dKyah?\d%K%P
「咿呀？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dDon't scream. Nothing's been decided yet. We're only\ntalking about what-ifs.\d%K%P
「声音太大了。\n还没有完全决定呢。\n只是说有可能」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dToko's transferring to another school...?\d%K%P
「小都子要、转校…？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dAnd to the countryside?!\d%K%P
「还是去那种地方！？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dAh, you should probably choose your words more carefully,\nunless you want all the locals to come at you with\npitchforks.\d%K%P
「啊～，你这说法，小心让那个地方的人发怒哦」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dTh-This is way too sudden. Why is she talking about stuff\nthat hasn't been decided yet?\d%K%P
「怎、怎么会…这也太突然了吧。\n为什么要突然把这种还没决定的事说出来啊」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dThat's probably because we blamed her for hiding that\nother thing from us. I'm glad she decided to tell us\neverything so early this time.\d%K%P
「我们说过『有事别藏着掖着』了的吧？\n都子也希望我们有事就早点说出来」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC伦子
\dYeah, and this is how the distance between Hinosaka and\nmyself slowly shortens by every day, every minute...\d%K%P
「可她要转校了」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\dShe's transferring schools, though.\d%K%P
「还没有决定呢！」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dIt hasn't been decided yet!\d%K%P
「唔」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dEek!\d%K%P
「都说了别那么大声，你这个脂肪细胞」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\dI told you to stop shouting, fathead.\d%K%P
「那个不对吧，应该是叫单细胞吧。\n而且我也没有那样的新陈代谢」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dHey, that's not right. What happened to your usual\nblockhead? Besides, I'm more fit than you'll ever be.\d%K%P
「可是，可是啊，就算是这样也不至于要转校吧。\n至少再待一年，等到毕业都不行吗？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dBut... But... It's weird... Can't she just wait another\nyear until we graduate?\d%K%P
「就靠她独自一人苦撑？同时还要照看公寓？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC真鹤
\dAll on her own? And taking care of a boarding house?\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC刚志
\dUh...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC伦子
\d...\d%K%P
「还是说我们要帮助都子？\n谁当爸爸谁当妈妈？\n谁来工作赚钱养活那孩子？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC真鹤
\dOr do we save her? Who wants to be the father, and who\nwants to be the mother? Who wants to work and look after\nher, hm?\d%K%P
「伦、伦子…\n你也没必要说得这么冷漠」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dR-Rinko... You don't need to be that cold.\d%K%P
「区别于感性的理性部分让我反倒松了口气。\n因为现在的状况，你们觉得对都子来说幸福吗？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC真鹤
\dEmotions aside, my reasonable self actually feels relief.\nI mean, do you think Toko is happy in her current\nsituation?\d%K%P
「那个…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC刚志
\dThat's...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC伦子
\d...\d%K%P
「如果她去了那边，就有监护人了。\n也不会为钱而发愁。将来的升学也一定没问题」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC真鹤
\dShe has people to look after here over there, and she\nwon't have any financial troubles, either. She'll probably\nbe able to continue attending school without any\nproblems.\d%K%P
「可、可是，如果带她过去的人\n其实是非常坏的人呢？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dB-But what if the person who takes her in turns out to\nbe, like, really evil, or a pervert or something?\d%K%P
「那样的话，回来就好了嘛。\n我们什么时候都欢迎都子回来吧？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC真鹤
\dThen she can just come right back. We'll welcome her with\nopen arms, right?\d%K%P
「那、那是当然了…可是，可是啊…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC刚志
\dO-Of course, but... but...!\d%K%P
「好，决定了。\n我，要向阳坂告白」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dAll right! I'm gonna confess to her!\d%K%P
「诶、诶诶！？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dE-Ehh?!\d%K%P
「…之前没有打算做么？告白。\n还有，之前没做好准备么？牺牲」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\dUh, remember the last time you confessed? Because that\nhappened. And you got shot down. Because that happened,\ntoo.\d%K%P
「很遗憾…\n我可不想把那些都变成苦涩的回忆」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC伦子
\dWell... I'm not planning to become just a memory!\d%K%P
「话说以现在的状况来看，有能成为你回忆的事么？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\dYou actually expected her to remember you?\d%K%P
「我要让阳坂知道我的认真。\n让她喜欢上我，\n喜欢到不能从我身边离开」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dI'm gonna show her how serious I am! I'm gonna make her\nfall for me so hard she won't be able to leave!\d%K%P
「刚、刚志君！？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dTs-Tsuyoshi?!\d%K%P
「你听别人说话了吗？\n我在说都子的幸福啊」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\dWere you listening to what I said? Her happiness is...\d%K%P
「也许现在会很辛苦…但总有一天，\n她会感到幸福，觉得和我在一起真是太好了…\n我一定会让她对我这么说的！」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC伦子
\dIt might be difficult at first, but I'll make sure that\none day, she'll be able to say she made the right choice\nand is happy! I swear on my life!\d%K%P
「…这个单细胞生物」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\d...Damn blockhead.\d%K%P
「对，没错！\n今后不会再弄错了吧？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dYes, that's it! Make sure not to get it wrong the next\ntime.\d%K%P
「你还真能接受“单细胞”这个评价啊…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC刚志
\dAre you seriously okay with being called that...\d%K%P
「因此呢…明天『自称』的学习会，\n你们能回避下么？\n我有话想对阳坂单独说说」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dBesides, our 'study group' is tomorrow! Could you two\nmaybe skip it this time? I'd like to have a private\nconversation with Hinosaka.\d%K%P
「不行不行不行不行不行！」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC伦子
\dN-No! No! No! Nooo!\d%K%P
