%LCRinko
%LC刚志
\d...Seriously? Do you have any idea how long we've been\npreparing for this?\d%K%P
「我知道啊，因此我真的感到很抱歉。\n可是，如果错过明天的话说不定就没有机会了！」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC真鹤
\dI do. And I'm really sorry. But if I don't do anything\ntomorrow, I might not have another chance.\d%K%P
「刚志君…」%K%P
