%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dUm, I recall your mother having trouble with quite a\nfew--\d%K%P
「那家伙和妈妈也发生过很多事啊。\n尽管如此，还和别的女人同居。\n这不是更加过分了么」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\dHe also had a relationship with Mom, allegedly! And now\nhe's living happily with some other woman. He's -twice- as\nbad as anyone we ever had!\d%K%P
