%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dAre you sure that's true? I feel he actually wants to\ncome back.\d%K%P
「那就回来亲口告诉我啊！\n虽然我也不会就此原谅他」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\dThen maybe he should come here and speak for himself! Not\nlike I'm planning to forgive him anyway!\d%K%P
「…你倒是原谅他啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\d...I think you should let him off the hook.\d%K%P
「但是从那之后，他一直在那个女人的房间里，\n对此也不去辩解。一直在一起…\n２４小时一直在一起…啊啊，那家伙干了些什么啊！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\dI mean, he's been in that woman's room ever since!\nThere's just no excusing it anymore! They're together all\nthe time... twenty-four hours a day! It makes me sick to\neven imagine what they might be doing in there...\d%K%P
「…你还是尽量少听小八他的轶事比较好哦，小房东」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dUm, maybe you should refrain from talking to Hattsuan too\nmuch, Young Mistress.\d%K%P
