「那顺序反了吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\dThat's totally backwards.\d%K%P
「不，没有反。\n正因为不能面对小房东，\n所以才会去麻烦那位小姐了啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dIt's not backwards at all. My guess is that he's only\nhiding behind that other girl because he cannot bring\nhimself to face you, Young Mistress.\d%K%P
「为什么啊？我是不会生气的吧？\n…虽然前不久我因为老师的事而觉得他不检点，\n但还是在电话里原谅他了啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\dWhy? I wasn't even angry at him at that point. ...Well, I\nguess I acted a bit nasty regarding that divorce thing\nwith Ms. Kouno, but we made up over the phone later,\nokay?\d%K%P
「好不容易再就业的公司，说破产就破产了…\n所以他是觉得自己无法保护小房东了吧」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dThe place where he finally found a job collapsed less\nthan a month after he was hired, and once again he found\nhimself powerless to fulfill his promise of protecting\nyou.\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「因此他不敢来见你了…之后就这么拖着。\n这正是小少爷所擅长的自我堕落啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dAnd so he couldn't come back home to face you, one thing\nled to another, and we ended up with this chaotic mess.\nSounds just like him.\d%K%P
「…像个傻瓜一样」%K%P
