「…真的么？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\d...I wonder if I'm misremembering things.\d%K%P
「是那样的！\n我完全没有期待他会保护我！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\dYes, you are! I wasn't expecting him to protect me or\nanything, okay?!\d%K%P
