%LCKihee
%LC美都子
\dHe wants you to feel sorry for him for having betrayed\nyour expectations. At the same time, though, he regrets\ncausing you sadness, which leaves him unable to come back\nand face you. ...It's a complicated matter.\d%K%P
「…果然啊，像个傻瓜一样」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC喜兵卫
\d...It's beyond stupid.\d%K%P
